Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Objetivos:",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \n1) Definir el momento de fuerza \n2) Conocer las condiciones de \
equilibrio est\[AAcute]tico \n3) Entender el concepto de centro de gravedad y \
estabilidad"
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9593403527396336`*^9, 3.959340455635849*^9}, {
  3.9603721514488716`*^9, 3.9603721541674423`*^9}},
 Background->GrayLevel[
  0.85],ExpressionUUID->"050cc51f-2854-5a41-8150-c7537568c23c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Un cuerpo r\[IAcute]gido es un objeto o sistema de part\[IAcute]culas en el \
que las distancias entre part\[IAcute]culas son fijas y constantes. (BUFFA)\n\
Un cuerpo r\[IAcute]gido puede someterse a uno o a ambos tipos de movimiento: \
traslacional y rotacional.\n",
 StyleBox["El movimiento traslacional",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " es b\[AAcute]sicamente el movimiento rectil\[IAcute]neo, todas sus part\
\[IAcute]culas tienen la misma velocidad instant\[AAcute]nea.  \n",
 StyleBox["El movimiento rotacional (puro)",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", todas las part\[IAcute]culas del objeto tienen la misma velocidad angular \
instant\[AAcute]nea y viajan en c\[IAcute]rculos en torno al eje de rotaci\
\[OAcute]n.\nEl movimiento general de los cuerpos r\[IAcute]gidos es una \
combinaci\[OAcute]n de movimiento traslacional y rotacional."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9604631139061775`*^9, {3.9604635270836334`*^9, 3.9604635417559013`*^9}, {
   3.962184415458521*^9, 3.962184419781843*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"50b3a3ca-df4d-3142-9a32-4b826b65ef5b"],

Cell["\<\
En el siguiente simulador se muestra un ejemplo de un cuerpo r\[IAcute]gido \
(una llave inglesa) que esta en un movimiento de ca\[IAcute]da libre e \
ilustra la combinaci\[OAcute]n del movimiento rotacional alrededor del centro \
de masa y el movimiento traslacional. El centro de masa es el punto de un \
objeto que sigue la misma trayectoria que seguir\[IAcute]a una \
part\[IAcute]cula puntual con la misma masa. \
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9604635052358685`*^9, 3.9604635106154137`*^9}, {
   3.960463555462597*^9, 3.960463610997181*^9}, 3.965932702547367*^9, {
   3.977657773207694*^9, 3.977657773485361*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  1, 0.925, 0.925],ExpressionUUID->"a2209797-3924-2c40-a395-5bbae8862a90"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Manipulate", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", "82"}], ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", "10"}], ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"40", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"RGBColor", "[", 
             RowBox[{".49", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Point", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"vx", " ", "time"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"-", "9.8"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"time", "^", "2"}], "/", "2"}]}], ",", "0"}], "}"}], 
             "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"time", ",", "0", ",", "t", ",", ".25"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
         "Gray", ",", 
        RowBox[{"Translate", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Rotate", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"gr", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\[Omega]", " ", "t"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"vx", " ", "t"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", "9.8"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"t", "^", "2"}], "/", "2"}]}], ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "10"}], ",", "40"}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "82"}], ",", "10"}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", "10"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"SphericalRegion", "->", "True"}], ",", 
