     "], {{0, 284.4}, {463.79999999999995`, 0}}, {0, 255},
     ColorFunction->RGBColor,
     ImageResolution->{120., 120.},
     RasterInterpolation->"High"],
    BoxForm`ImageTag["Byte", ColorSpace -> "RGB", Interleaving -> True],
    Selectable->False],
   DefaultBaseStyle->"ImageGraphics",
   ImageSize->{513.5999999999999, Automatic},
   ImageSizeRaw->{463.79999999999995`, 284.4},
   PlotRange->{{0, 463.79999999999995`}, {0, 284.4}}]],
  TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->
  "f83c575f-b374-e042-8f11-cfeaa42cbb39"],
 "\nLa figura muestra un pie con una longitud de 22 cm elevado en una persona \
que tiene una masa de 80 kg. \nSe trata de una palanca de segundo nivel: el \
punto de apoyo corresponde a los dedos del pie, la fuerza impulsora ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["F", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "F", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c4a862c6-e1b0-b94f-b0a0-1b226b41a886"],
 " la proporciona el m\[UAcute]sculo de la pantorrilla, que ejerce una fuerza \
sobre el tend\[OAcute]n de Aquiles, y la fuerza de resistencia ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["R", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "R", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "26742486-4038-d04e-9176-696bee6ff086"],
 " es la fuerza de gravedad ejercida por el cuerpo sobre ese pie. "
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9659288336466312`*^9, 3.965928981093277*^9}, {
   3.9659290580301247`*^9, 3.9659291003836727`*^9}, 3.9659297793748837`*^9, {
   3.9659381589771175`*^9, 3.9659381589771175`*^9}, 3.977657950991828*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"15f99375-81bf-8b4a-8ed3-15523e1ac875"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"m2", "=", "80"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"R2", "=", 
  RowBox[{"m2", "*", "g", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(*", 
    RowBox[{"peso", " ", "del", " ", "cuerpo", " ", "humano"}], 
    "*)"}]}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965929123772749*^9, 3.9659291809402714`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[126]:=",ExpressionUUID->"18457a70-674f-2a4c-81a1-41053ab3842d"],

Cell[BoxData["784.8000000000001`"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9659291833482704`*^9, 3.9776656644412518`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[127]=",ExpressionUUID->"a0f97733-f4be-48c0-8940-6211d03e6baa"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Suponiendo que todas las fuerzas son verticales y que la fuerza de \
resistencia se aplica a una distancia de 14 cm del punto de apoyo.\n\n\
Aplicando la condici\[OAcute]n de equilibrio, la fuerza impulsora ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["F", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "F ",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "61698f58-498b-9b45-8081-193f7fc7d792"],
 " se puede calcular:\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["d", "TI"], "1"], 
         StyleBox["F", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["d", "TI"], "2"], 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "d_1 F=d_2R", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "cebbd662-3f25-fb41-a597-579487675a28"],
 " \n\nDespejando para ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["F", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "F", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c8d8c0c6-d630-ae43-ae51-ae44daa90061"],
 " , tenemos: \n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["F", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["d", "TI"], "2"], 
            StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["d", "TI"], "1"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "F=\\frac{d_2 R}{d_1}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8636c3a0-80b0-c44c-a1cc-931f51c878f2"]
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9659289951442146`*^9, {3.96592908674889*^9, 3.9659290965075207`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"754df1af-4dc4-6f46-a1c2-36bf69778746"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"d1", "=", "22"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"d2", "=", "14"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"F2", "=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"d2", "*", "R2"}], ")"}], "/", "d1"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9659291936007633`*^9, 3.9659291948938637`*^9}, {
  3.9659292287411213`*^9, 3.9659292724348125`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[128]:=",ExpressionUUID->"50c1e9e3-5c82-9241-b6bb-f019e12bc3d7"],

Cell[BoxData["499.4181818181819`"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9659292734833527`*^9, 3.977665664444379*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[130]=",ExpressionUUID->"55a63838-ddaf-4ea8-8995-f84fd5ba6a80"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Entonces los m\[UAcute]sculos deben ejercer una gran fuerza de \
aproximadamente 500 N. La fuerza de reacci\[OAcute]n sobre los dedos del pies \
es: \
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965929456347353*^9, 3.965929471754158*^9}, {
  3.96592969323967*^9, 3.965929728622801*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"a71d040f-e929-c947-bee8-7136664196de"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"R2", "-", "F2"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9659297402547207`*^9, 3.9659297443197403`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[131]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2cf359fe-f5e0-c249-8629-c89ab277ffd0"],

Cell[BoxData["285.3818181818182`"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.965929747069149*^9, 3.977665664447173*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[131]=",ExpressionUUID->"354654e0-5058-411b-b0c4-1f2a9f7602cc"]
}, Open  ]],

